**4.1.2 PROCEDURE AND INPUT PARAMETERS**

In our simulation study we follow the general procedure and input parameters (beam parameters and detector geometry related parameters, for our case and for experimental Phase I setup) given below:

* Parametrize all beamline elements, as explained above. Construct beamline from IP to detector position (RP), specify beamline length: \(L_{beamline}\) = 58.496 m.
